'''Tiny storage units''' are found in resource rooms within the [[Chambers of Xeric]]. It allows players to store 25 of their personal items.

It can be upgraded for the duration of the raid with [[Mallignum root plank]]s and a [[hammer]] or [[dragon warhammer]], into a [[Small storage unit]] with two planks, a [[Medium storage unit]] with four planks, a [[Large storage unit]] with six, and a [[Massive storage unit]] with eight, requiring 30, 60, 90, and 99 [[Construction]] respectively. Upgrades are shared between all storage units and players in the current raid.

'''Note:''' Players who leave the Chambers with their personal items still stored in the storage units can retrieve them from the private storage unit next to the bank chest on the Mountain. The private storage unit '''must be emptied''' before players re-enter the Chambers of Xeric. Items left in the storage unit will '''not''' be lost if the player dies outside of the Chambers of Xeric.

